╭─ oge · demo · main ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Describe the task                                                            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
   ctrl+c                 clear the queued Task, else cancel the Run
 Full screen
   pgup · pgdown · wheel  scroll the transcript (drag selects and copies)
   ctrl+end · end         jump to the latest
   ctrl+t                 show or hide the sidebar (from 110 columns)
   ctrl+o                 unfold long commands and diffs
   alt+y                  copy the last reply
 Delivery
   ↓ on an empty box      the actions of the last Run
   a · b · d · r          apply · branch · diff · receipt (each ↓ allows one)
 Setup
   tab · esc              close setup
   ↑ ↓ · enter            move · change the row
   s · w                  save as default · write the project Checks
   d · x                  remove the row
 Vim (when enabled)
   esc · i a I A o O      NORMAL · INSERT (enter runs in both)
   h j k l                left · down · up · right (k, j at the edge: history)
   w e b                  next word · word end · previous (NORMAL)
   0 ^ $                  line start · first char · end (NORMAL)
 ↑ ↓ scroll (41-60 of 65) · esc or ? close
